kind (the ten web switch arms + the default:null arm), applies the stat-hero field ?? 'distance' default,
resolves the drive-highlight selection (which drive + t('yearReview.longestDrive'|'mostEfficient') + emoji),
parses the bg-gradient-to-br Tailwind class into a three-stop canvas, and slides the slide in (AnimatePresence
+ motion.div keyed by slideIndex, reduce-motion aware). The ten child slides (Title/StatHero/StatChart/
DriveHighlight/ChargingBreakdown/Savings/Environment/Patterns/Comparisons/Summary) are sibling surfaces with
their own prompts (W-0061..W-0070) and are OUT OF SCOPE; they are hosted through the ISlideContentFactory
seam (the native analogue of the web child-component imports). loading/error/stale/offline belong to the
